### 404 NOT FOUND
### ========================================

GET http://localhost:3001/api/resources/not-existing-id
###

GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/not-existing-id
###

GET http://localhost:3001/api/comments/not-existing-id
###
GET http://localhost:3001/api/ratings/not-existing-id

###
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/health

### SQLi після виправлення
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/resources?search=%27%20OR%20%271%27%3D%271

### IDOR без заголовка
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/comments/2

### IDOR чужий користувач
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/comments/2
X-Demo-UserId: 3

### IDOR власник
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/comments/2
X-Demo-UserId: 4

### IDOR update чужого коментаря
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/v1/comments/2
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 3

{
  "text": "спроба змінити чужий коментар"
}


### IDOR delete чужого коментаря
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/v1/comments/2
X-Demo-UserId: 3

